msgid "Vault（保险库）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/vault.md:8
msgid ""
"用户与 Agent 的加密凭据库。权威存储为 ECS `vault_item` / `vault_config`"
"（User + Agent 两个 private world）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/vault.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "双库"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/vault.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 库    | 模式                                            | 解密位置                  | 典型用途                         |\n"
"| ----- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n"
"| User  | `master_password`                               | Portal / 浏览器扩展客户端 | 人类密码、TOTP、卡片             |\n"
"| Agent | `machine`（`~/.anima/vault/agent-machine.key`） | Habitat                   | 工具 `secrets[]`、`vault()` 配置 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/vault.md:17
msgid ""
"LLM **从不**看到明文密钥，只见元数据；注入经 `terminal_run` / `code_execute` "
"`secrets[]` 或 `browser_type` `secret`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/vault.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "条目模型（摘要）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/vault.md:24
msgid "类型：`login` | `secure_note` | `card` | `identity` | `custom`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/vault.md:24
msgid ""
"明文 meta：`title`、`url`、`uris[]`（`uri` + `match`）、`username`、`tags`、"
"`import_refs`（如 `bitwarden` UUID）、`custom_field_names`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/vault.md:24
msgid ""
"密文：`secrets_enc` + `dek_wrapped`；载荷含 `password` / `totp` / `notes` / "
"`custom_fields` / `card` / `identity`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/vault.md:24
msgid ""
"`url` 为主展示 URI；`uris` 供 Bitwarden 式匹配（`domain` / `host` / "
"`starts_with` / `exact` / `regex` / `never`）。无 `uris` 时对 `url` 做 "
"domain 匹配"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/vault.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shell UI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/vault.md:29
msgid "路由：`/vault`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/vault.md:29
msgid ""
"解锁 / 改密 / CRUD；用户库导入 **Bitwarden 未加密 JSON**（按 "
"`import_refs.bitwarden` 幂等 upsert；可选「仅新建」）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/vault.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "浏览器扩展（浏览器形态入口）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/vault.md:37
msgid "入口：`src/portal/extension`（WXT MV3；`runtime/` + `features/vault/`）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/vault.md:37
msgid "开发：`just dev browser-extension`（或 `bunx wxt`）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/vault.md:37
msgid ""
"连接：扩展 **直连 Habitat**（Bearer `fa_at_…`），HTTP REST only；主密码仅扩展"
"内存会话（默认 15 分钟）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/vault.md:37
msgid ""
"能力：按 URL 匹配填充、弹窗、保存提示、密码生成、右键菜单、快捷键、卡片/身份"
"填充"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/vault.md:39
msgid ""
"加载未打包扩展：Chrome → 扩展程序 → 开发者模式 → 加载已解压的扩展程序 → 选择 "
"`dist/browser-extension/chrome-mv3`。"
msgstr ""

